dmenu - dynamic menu
====================
dmenu is an efficient dynamic menu for X.

Heavily modified dmenu build for my daily use. All patches inspected
refactored and fully integrated. Liberal changes to the source code
driven by personal preference. Command line parameters documented
in the manual and other relevant functionality listed below.
Examples in `script/`.

credit
------
fork of <https://tools.suckless.org/dmenu>.

install
-------
`sudo make install clean`

manual
------
`man dmenu`

patch
-----
- [border](https://tools.suckless.org/dmenu/patches/border)
  optional window border

- [center](https://tools.suckless.org/dmenu/patches/center)
  window centering
  + optional min max width

- [colored-caret](https://tools.suckless.org/dmenu/patches/colored-caret)
  caret color

- [case-insensitive](https://tools.suckless.org/dmenu/patches/case-insensitive)
  default case insensitive matching

- [fuzzymatch](tools.suckless.org/dmenu/patches/fuzzymatch)
  fuzzy text matching
  + custom match algorithm
  + case-insensitive compatibility

- [fuzzyhighlight](https://tools.suckless.org/dmenu/patches/fuzzyhighlight)
  fuzzy text highlighting
  + custom match algorithm
  + fuzzymatch compatibility

- [line-height](https://tools.suckless.org/dmenu/patches/line-height)
  adjustable line height

- [no-default-select](https://tools.suckless.org/dmenu/patches/no-default-select)
  optional item selection

- [no-input](https://tools.suckless.org/dmenu/patches/no-input)
  optional hidden input

- [numbers](https://tools.suckless.org/dmenu/patches/numbers)
  optional item counter

- [restrict-return](https://tools.suckless.org/dmenu/patches/restrict-return)
  optional restricted output

- [vertfull](https://tools.suckless.org/dmenu/patches/vertfull)
  full width vertical rendering

- [tmenu](https://tools.suckless.org/dmenu/patches/tmenu)
  separate matching and output values

- leading icons
  + optional display only prefix

- hidden arrows
  + optional cleaner interface
